{
  "name": "Winter's Touch",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the Frostbite cantrip. Additionally, you can start to use your control over cold to hamper your foes. Once per turn, when you damage one or more creatures with a weapon attack or a spell that does cold damage, you can use your Reaction to reduce the movement Speed of any of those creatures by 10 feet until the end of your next turn.</p>",
